<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cdelete (245)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cdelete &lt;clan id&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>cdelete clan_koh
</pre>
<p>Deletes a clan for good. Give its id, the first line of its entry in 
clanlist.data (such as clan_koh), not its full name.
</p><p>Every member is removed: those online at once, with the message that they 
have been removed from the clan, a title saying they were banished from 
it, and their home set back to the temple of Udgaard. Members who are 
offline are put on a list and removed the next time they log in. Then the 
clan's member list, ranks, money and stored equipment are deleted, and 
the clan is taken out of clanlist.data.
</p><p>There is no undo. The clan's zone stays; take it out of the game 
separately if you want it gone. It is logged.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Cstat</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan</a>
</pre>




</div>